  "body": "Agnes Baker deck only. Advanced.\n【Revelation】 - Put Dark Memory into play in your threat area, with 3 charges on it. It cannot leave play while it has 1 or more charges on it.\n【Forced】 - When you would succeed at a skill test on an ability printed on a {Spell} card you control, reveal an additional token for that tets and remove 1 charge from <fullname>. Then, if <fullname> has no charges on it, discard it. (Limit once per test.)\n",
